begincodeV2
name:炮塔'守方放置
comment:给一名玩家创建炮塔
params:Struct player
return:Mech 玩家炮塔
lines:
Float xMin=fun float.multiply(var 地图宽度:Float -0.5)
varf Float.xMin.addEqual(Float 5)
Float xMax=fun float.multiply(var 地图宽度:Float 0.5)
varf Float.xMax.minusEqual(Float 5)
Float offset1=act 1101./参数调节模块.读取(String 留白区域1:Float 5:Float 3:Float 20:Color 0,0,0,255)
Float offset2=act 1101./参数调节模块.读取(String 留白区域2:Float 10:Float 5:Float 20:Color 0,0,0,255)
Float temp2=fun float.add(var offset1:var offset2)
Float temp2=fun float.multiply(var temp2:Float -1)
Float temp1=fun float.multiply(var 地图宽度:Float 0.5)
Float zMax=fun float.add(var temp2:var temp1)
varf Float.zMax.minusEqual(Float 5)
Float zMin=fun float.multiply(var 地图宽度:Float -0.5)
varf Float.zMin.addEqual(Float 5)
Float x=fun math.rand(var xMin:var xMax)
Float z=fun math.rand(var zMin:var zMax)
Vector3 relative=fun creatVariable.Vector3(var x:Float 50:var z)
Vector3 global=fun vector3.add(var relative:var ScenarioOffset)
Mech 玩家炮塔=act 1101.this.Base'SetBase(Long 2:var global:Vector3 0,0,-1:String 守方炮塔:Long 21:var player)
Float 守方玩家数=fun map.getCustomFloat(String 守方玩家数)
varf Float.守方玩家数.addEqual(Float 1)
fun map.setCustomFloat(String 守方玩家数:var 守方玩家数)
endcode